>     1) how can I extract the indicator error term variances? I imagine I
>     use inspect somehow but couldn't figure it out. I want to calculate
>     composite reliability and average variance extracted, and I have
>     many indicators so I'd like to dump the variances into a vector to
>     manipulate.

An alternative way, as often used inside the lavaan source code:

ov.names <- lavNames(fit, "ov")
PE <- parameterEstimates(fit)
ev <- PE[ PE$op=="~~" &
           PE$lhs %in% ov.names &
           PE$lhs == PE$rhs,
          "est"]

Yves.

